s, so no flag is attached — but this does not excuse the segment itself [F14][RD-6]."}, {"id": "C7", "reason": "RD-6's repeated-breach condition requires route_disputes_upheld_90d ≥ 1; the driver's 90-day record shows 1 upheld dispute but 0 route disputes upheld, so the account flag is not engaged by this single finding [F14][RD-6]."}], "flag_account": false, "escalate": false}
